-Technically a worse,
less important department.

00:12:18.534 --> 00:12:20.934
-I haven't really gotten
to talk to Frank very much.

00:12:20.934 --> 00:12:23.501
-Frank doesn't
have to talk to you.

00:12:23.501 --> 00:12:25.467
-Oh, I'm sorry. I didn't --
-You have no idea

00:12:25.467 --> 00:12:28.467
