be standing in his house.

00:12:32.734 --> 00:12:35.667
-I'm just excited.
I'm sorry.

00:12:35.667 --> 00:12:38.667
I was just excited.
Okay.

00:12:38.667 --> 00:12:41.567
-Nick Kroll, everybody!
[ Cheers and applause ]

